\subsection{Module Parameterization}

Each module $\mathcal{M}_i$ is parameterized by a transformation operator
$\mathcal{T}_i$:
\[
\Theta_i = \mathcal{T}_i(\mathbf{\Omega}_0),
\]
yielding the full parameter set:
\[
\Theta_{\text{MPS--PCE}} =
\{\Theta_A,\, \Theta_B,\, \Theta_C,\, \Theta_D\}.
\]

\subsubsection{Genetic Module ($\mathcal{M}_A$)}
Genomic variants from NGS panels are mapped into gene regulatory network
interaction coefficients:
\[
k_{mn} = k_{mn}^{(0)} + \sum_{j} \alpha_{mn,j} \Delta_j,
\]
where $\Delta_j$ denotes variant effect sizes.

\subsubsection{Pathogen Module ($\mathcal{M}_B$)}
