\subsubsection{Trauma Module ($\mathcal{M}_C$)}
Acute physiological stress is modeled via homeostatic deviation dynamics:
\[
\frac{d\mathbf{y}}{dt} = f_C(\mathbf{y}; \Theta_C),
\]
where $\mathbf{y}$ includes electrolytes, lactate, ABG parameters, and
